  "question": "Within three role-matched AI-infrastructure issuer pairs, which differences remain after applying one frozen quarterly filing contract?",
  "finding": {
    "headline": "Similar top-line growth did not imply similar margin, research-spending or share-count profiles.",
    "statement": "The networking and server pairs show the same caution from two angles: relatively close revenue-growth rates coexisted with wider differences in at least one of gross margin, R&D intensity or diluted-share change. The compute pair differed materially across all four observations.",
    "boundary": "This is a six-issuer descriptive comparison, not a factor, composite score, synchronized calendar-quarter ranking or return forecast."
  },
